#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:5 59c661cb86d94d2ca04ee436c24b2bb8
msgid "RTL Mode"
msgstr "RTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:7 f507aae001fd41e3aacab7370597d0a4
msgid ""
"RTL stands for Return-To-Launch.  When switched into RTL mode the vehicle "
"will turn and attempt to directly return to the position where it was last "
"armed (unless the home position has been changed via the ground station). "
"Once at the destination it will hold position if a surface vehicle, or "
"loiter/circle around the destination if it is a boat."
msgstr ""
"RTL 代表返回起飞点（Return-To-Launch）。切换至 RTL "
"模式后，车辆将转向并尝试直接返回最后一次解锁时的位置（除非通过地面站更改了归航点）。到达目的地后，若为地面车辆则原地保持，若为船则在目的地附近 "
"Loiter/盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:9 4c506067dcf04e5db2407abee6ae9040
msgid ""
"The :ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` parameter can be used to set the speed (in "
"meters/second) at which the vehicle will return to home.  By default this "
"parameter is zero meaning it will use the :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` (or "
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` for versions before Rover 4.0, if "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` is 0)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` 参数可用于设置车辆返航速度（单位：米/秒）。默认值为零，表示使用 :ref:`WP_SPEED"
" <WP_SPEED>`（或 Rover 4.0 之前版本中若 :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 为 0 则使用 "
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`）。"
